! STEOM-DLPNO-CCSD def2-SVP def2-SVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF TightPNO
# SERIAL PATCH for the exceptional-point problem: serial ORCA TOLERATES non-converged EOM
# satellite roots (the high-double-character IP/EA states that coalesce into complex eigenpairs
# and that STEOM EXCLUDES from the transformation anyway) and proceeds, whereas parallel aborts.
# Lets the real bright pi->pi* (which converges) come through.
# Clean 54-atom model: CR2 + full Tyr203, His148 in MM (no CT contamination). CPU-only.
%maxcore 16000
%pal nprocs 1 end
%pointcharges "field_chrtyr.pc"
%mdci
  NRoots 3
  DoRootWise true
  DoStoreSTEOM true
  AddL2Term True
  TCutPNOSingles 1e-12
  NDav 400
  MaxIter 200
end
* xyzfile -1 1 geom_chrtyr.xyz
